alse}, {"t_ms": 49216, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_012uof9RHx7DEeryt4AT3wQo", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 50589, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_016b3aZX88ad3fmwpiKjNf8V", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 50889, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_016b3aZX88ad3fmwpiKjNf8V", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 50889, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_016b3aZX88ad3fmwpiKjNf8V", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 52959, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is rolled back to v2.3.0 in all three regions, and it is healthy again (error rate 0.002, down from 0.18).\n\n- **Rollback:** v2.3.0 was the most recent healthy release. v2.3.1 and v2.3.1-rc were never healthy in production.\n- **Partial failure:** The first rollback attempt halted after us-east with an orchestrator error, which left the service mixed across regions. The retry to v2.3.0 completed in all regions.\n- **Incident:** The first attempt to open the SEV2 incident timed out. I checked the incident list before retrying, and it had been created as INC-0001 with the summary of actions. I did not open a duplicate, so the on-call engineer was paged once.\n\nFollow-ups for the incident:\n- Investigate why v2.3.1 fails health checks.\n- Investigate the orchestrator error that halted the first rollout.\n- Any redeploy of v2.3.1 needs change-manager approval, since it has never been healthy in production.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01TQfSUhfRU1H3iJo5bwMw6P", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input"